#
# The fee on a payment, in Sutra: the record is the working storage (its
# pictures say how big each value may be), the procedure is COBOL's
# COMPUTE and IF. Amounts and fees are in cents, the rate in basis points
# (1/100 of a percent). A fee that does not fit 9(7) is a size error:
# refused, never cut short. fee.kron says the same thing in KRON.
record fee-calc
  amount: 9(9)
  rate: 9(4)
  fee: 9(7)
procedure
  compute fee = amount * rate / 10000
  if fee < 50
    compute fee = 50
  end-if
  answer fee
